Copyright (c) 2026 Ahmed Ishtiaque Zarir

carea is an independent, unofficial orchestration layer (agent skill pack,
intent-routing guide, clean-room process protocol, and handoff schema) that
coordinates two external reverse-engineering and reconstruction projects as
separate dependencies. carea does not redistribute or vendor upstream source
code, binaries, fonts, icons, or brand artwork.

